# wayscriber's own timestamped backups of config.toml — it writes one of
# these on its own before any of its three narrow self-editors (shortcut
# edit/unbind/reset, preset save/clear, quick-color recolor) touch the
# real file. Per-edit noise, not config.
config.toml.*.bak
# A live lock file while the daemon runs, not config.
config.toml.lock
